tms 1
title Bamboo Lantern Walk
mood paper lanterns swaying between the stalks, something watching from the dark
author Claude (original)
tempo 96
loop yes

; A minor with a raised seventh (E major) to pull the tune back round. A drives with sixteenth-note arpeggios, B lifts to C.
